{"about_the_game":"Space Ace, the follow up to Don Bluth's legendary Dragon's Lair, can now be enjoyed from the comfort of your home. This fully arcade authentic version includes all of the original scenes you've come to enjoy, and even an all-new global high scores list so you can show how well you handle Ace's laser gun. Other bonuses include a full watch feature to sit back and enjoy Don Bluth's stunning animation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Space Ace you play the heroic Ace who must stop the evil Commander Borf from taking over the Earth! Borf plans to reduce all of humankind to infants and take over the planet. Only two people have the courage and strength to stop Borf and save Earth: the beautiful Kimberly and the heroic Ace. But as they approach Borf's stronghold, Ace is hit by the Infanto Ray, changing him into a child, and Kimberly is kidnapped by the evil madman! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Fate Of Earth Is In Your hands!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Regain Your Manhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240340/a38a047ea4bc0a5420ce0bfd7e6a96104cf632da.jpg"},{"name":"Just Dex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240340/5e4696311b86010b71c75f3e2a1e89f7bedfac7e.jpg"},{"name":"Get the Popcorn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240340/ce797f8f4c863ee0162b939bc2c795706ff149a7.jpg"},{"name":"Oh Captain! My Captain!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240340/984b35b93d2a195a1807a1d27a57c7359d15fa44.jpg"},{"name":"Call Me Ace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240340/b546ba8b061b3fca11e5b73d88fb1c7e76b3785e.jpg"},{"name":"Infantilized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/240340/43015b13486ae8f2c75ec0ae1ad75aea2a2fc932.jpg"},{"name":"Go Go Ace!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image